 the municipal council, she is responsible for making decisions on local issues, such as urban planning, transportation, and community development.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Evidence of Holding the Position\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"According to the official website of the commune of Givry, Florence Bagnard is listed as a conseiller municipal de Givry.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[1] This information is also corroborated by local news sources, which have reported on her involvement in municipal council meetings and decisions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"In addition, the Yonne department's official website lists Florence Bagnard as a conseiller municipal de Givry, further substantiating her position.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"References\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"[1] Commune of Givry.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Conseil municipal.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.givry.fr\\\\/conseil-municipal\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"[2] Le Journal de l'Yonne.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"(2020, February 10).\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Givry: Le conseil municipal valide le budget 2020.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.lejournaldelyonne.fr\\\\/givry-2020-02-10-le-conseil-municipal-valide-le-budget-2020>\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"[3] Yonne Department.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Les élus du conseil municipal de Givry.\"}]}"
